// lexdb_exec: owners and privileges, checked against PostgreSQL 18
// (generated by tests/lexdb/gen_pg.py from privs_queries.txt), as a
// superuser acting as roles by SET ROLE: SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE and DELETE
// and when each needs SELECT too, RETURNING, a schema's USAGE and CREATE,
// ALL TABLES IN SCHEMA, a view read as its owner, membership, owners and
// OWNER TO, a sequence's USAGE, the catalog's answers, DROP ROLE.
// Each expect line: a query's rows or tag, or ERROR and its SQLSTATE.
// expect: DROP ROLE
// expect: CREATE ROLE
// expect: CREATE ROLE
// expect: CREATE ROLE
